#: features.js:889
msgid ""
"Answer five quick questions and I'll build a focus setup that fits how you "
"work — your rhythm, sounds, breaks and the help you need. You can fine-tune "
"everything later in Settings."
msgstr ""
"Besvar fem hurtige spørgsmål, så bygger jeg en fokusopsætning, der passer "
"til, hvordan du arbejder — din rytme, lyde, pauser og den hjælp, du har brug"
" for. Du kan finjustere alt senere i Indstillinger."

#: features.js:890
msgid "Let's go"
msgstr "Lad os gå i gang"

#: features.js:896 features.js:912
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Tilbage"

#: features.js:897
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Næste"

#: features.js:900
msgid "Your tailored setup 🍅"
msgstr "Din skræddersyede opsætning 🍅"

#: features.js:901
msgid ""
"Based on your answers, here's what I'll set up. Apply it now, then tweak "
"anything in Settings."
msgstr ""
"Ud fra dine svar er her, hvad jeg sætter op. Anvend det nu, og justér "
"derefter alt i Indstillinger."

#: features.js:913
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Anvend"

#: features.js:914
msgid "Apply & start"
msgstr "Anvend & start"

